[background arg="res://img/point_and_click/backgrounds/Game Jam 2026 Carpenter Background 1.png" fade="0.0"]
join Carpenter left
label carpenter_greeting
Carpenter: "If you're here to buy a new table, I'm fresh out."
- "Actually, I was wondering if you could build some barricades." | [if {recruitment.carpenter_recruited} == false]
	Carpenter: "Barricades for what?"
	Doomsayer: "The town is going to be attacked by goblins tonight, and we're going to try to defend from the church."
	Doomsayer: "Barricades would be useful if you'd be willing to build them."
	Carpenter: "Who's we?"
	if {recruitment.recruitees} == 0.0:
		Doomsayer: ...
		Carpenter: "Come back when you've got some more helping hands.\
		I'm not moving all this wood by myself."
		jump carpenter_greeting
	elif {recruitment.recruitees} == 1.0:
		Doomsayer: "I've got one person willing to help."
		Carpenter: "Come back when you've got a couple of folks.\
		Wood's heavier than you think."
		jump carpenter_greeting
	elif {recruitment.recruitees} >= 2.0:
		Doomsayer: "I found a few people willing to help."
		Carpenter: "Alright, I'll build those barricades."
		set {recruitment.carpenter_recruited} = true
		set {recruitment.recruitees} += 1.0
		jump carpenter_greeting
- Return to town square
	leave Carpenter
	jump village/square